I come out of the supermarket.
There is a vegetable cart on the street.
There are many fresh vegetables on the cart.
I go to the cart.
I like green vegetables.
I speak to the vendor.
"Brother, I want one kilo of tomatoes."
"I also want spinach."
The vendor shows me the tomatoes.
They are very beautiful.
I like fresh tomatoes.
I pick the best tomatoes.
He also gives the spinach.
The vendor weighs the vegetables.
The vegetables are now ready.
I like this cart.
